Accordingly, I pass the following;
ORDER i) The Criminal Petition is allowed.
ii) The First Information Report in Crime No.254/2022 registered by the Basavan Bagewadi Police Station, insofar it relates to petitioners - accused Nos.2 and 3, is hereby quashed.

